Master includes fixes since wav-0.14.6, flac-0.13.4 and mp3-0.7.4 that affect uploaded audio. This import
bounds WAV data by the available bytes, avoids signed shifts in FLAC's endian conversions, and updates MP3
frame matching and stereo scratch initialization. Earlier imports fixed dr_mp3's APE, Lyrics3v2 and Xing/Info
parsing, dr_wav's metadata parsing and integer overflows, and division and shift errors in dr_flac.

What was taken: dr_wav.h, dr_flac.h, dr_mp3.h and LICENSE. zspark's translation unit that defines the
implementations and their options is zig/src/audio/dr_libs.c, not here: decoding from memory to f32, without
stdio. Not taken: dr_libs' tests, CMake files and the other headers.
